            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">MAKE THE TIME</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"170\" width=\"900\" height=\"300\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.1)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"22\">\"Those who think they have not time</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"22\">for bodily exercise will sooner or later</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"22\">have to find time for illness.\"</text><text x=\"950\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"18\">-- Edward Stanley, 1873</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"560\" width=\"800\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"610\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Two sessions a week is an investment</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"645\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">in the strength you will need later</text></svg>",
            "caption": "A 150-year-old argument for strength training"
